      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have been saying they err on the side of safety for years. the quest headsets are a lot stronger than they give them credit for. shaders, particles, etc. \n\nI believe part of it is that they are trying to leave head room for avatars on top of whatever  worlds have, limiting so that you don't die with 2 people in a world with you. \n\nbut i do think they could include more in the quest SDK .",
